    "Pinned runtime minimum_linear_texture_alignment probes Vulkan image rowPitch per format; its buffer-backed texture accepts different pitches through synchronized copy.",
    "26C5035r GPUProcess.sb allows file-read under /Library/GPUBundles but executable mapping under /System/Library/Extensions; existing147-patch core already supplies opt-in read-only system view.",
    "NativeAdrenoMetalPlugin clientDevice already sets METAL2VULKAN_SHADER_CACHE_OPTIONAL; bridge previously ignored it. New bridge passes pipeline_cache_dir=None for the explicit fallback.",
    "Runtime-v2 automatically retires released allocations after250ms; nmb_device_release_kept_memory previously returned an unsupported error and has no synchronous trim API. Zero blocks returned now means no immediate release claimed.",
    "Samsung max77705-irq.c maps PD_INT bit4 Attention,bit3 Configure,bit2 Status and bit5 DataRole. VDM bit4 compatibility indication is also retained for Attention as requested.",
    "Stable platform namespace retained privately from the final delivered Review21 ADT; no new hardware identifier guessed or logged.",
    "Core/firmware/Touch/Bluetooth/USB-HAL protected hashes unchanged; only board policy,DP port,GPU log and runtime changes."
